cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the HELENA software version used in your work."
type: software
title: "HELENA: High-Energy Lepto-hadronic Emission and Neutrino Analysis"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Yangji
repository-code: "https://github.com/LiYangji/HELENA"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  HELENA calculates coupled particle transport and photon and neutrino emission
  in a one-zone steady-state jet model. Its maintained inference and
  differentiation path is photon-only; neutrino spectra are post-fit predictions.
  BSD-3-Clause applies to HELENA software, not additional rights in third-party
  example data or reference products; source-specific notices and attribution
  are documented in examples/README.md.
